      "value": "@{5a4aaf7f758fa46d131cd36b|full_name}: Heap manipulation ops (load and store) would allow people creating compilers to choose how to create their own structures in memory and optimize based on the program being compiled. Removing the burden on the vrchat devs to create a complex assembler that attempts to handle the optimizations without knowledge of the program source being compiled.",
